# Components Used

- Arduino UNO
- LDR Sensor
- IR Sensor
- LEDs
- Resistors
- Breadboard
- Jumper Wires
- USB Cable

# Wiring Connections

## LDR Sensor

VCC → 5V  
GND → GND  
OUT → A0

## LED Connections

Positive → Digital Pin  
Negative → GND

## IR Sensor

VCC → 5V  
GND → GND  
OUT → D2

# Circuit Diagram

The circuit includes:

- Arduino UNO
- LDR sensor for ambient light detection
- IR sensor for motion sensing
- LEDs representing street lights

A breadboard was used for prototype connections.
